      "updated": 1790933625796,
      "created": 1790603718519,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Zbv1EfN6TtwDdsFidVAGt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 223.26686835865235,
      "y": -12.388268264685848,
      "width": 636.87939453125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "xT81HrFoPtVTTyMO1_0jz"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 235302278,
      "version": 664,
      "versionNonce": 2134337606,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790933625796,
      "created": 1790603747300,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. It should rate limit incoming requests if no. of requests are larger than desired\n2. It should work for multiple users - multiple users should be rate limited\n3. Different API endpoints can have different rate limits\n4. The different user tiers can have different rate limits as well\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. It should rate limit incoming requests if no. of requests are larger than desired\n2. It should work for multiple users - multiple users should be rate limited\n3. Different API endpoints can have different rate limits\n4. The different user tiers can have different rate limits as well\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
