      "text": "For a bucket the\nconfigurable options are\nits capacity and the\nrefill rate",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cVY2mmWEnPNAj6BX2t-Ub",
      "originalText": "For a bucket the configurable options are its capacity and the refill rate",
